  "abstract": "Extends Osc2-CTX-FLoad with mean+velocity context for r[b,k], w[b,k], while keeping residual copy and temporal/horizon gating. Uses factorized loadings (k=320,p=32), stronger stability (a_max=0.997), \u03b3_end=0.995, MAE+curvature loss and V-orthogonality regularization (\u03bb=1e-5). Increment MLP H=96.",
